<div class="mandarin-hanzi">请</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">qǐng</div>

''Meaning:'' please; invite; request politely  
''Part of speech:'' verb; polite marker

!! In context
请坐。 — Qǐng zuò. — Please sit.

!! Usage note
Before a verb, 请 (qǐng) makes a request or invitation polite, as in 请坐. As a full verb, it can mean 'invite', 'request', or 'treat'.
